====Usage notes====
* While not inherently pejorative when referring to strangers, using ''Tante'' to refer to a woman is less polite than the male term ''[[Typ]]''. Unlike men with ''Typ'', usage of ''Tante'' by women to refer to themselves is a lot rarer and usually restricted to refer to a specific scene. (E.g. ''[[Motorrad]]tante'', 'biker chick'.) Calling a personal acquaintance a ''Tante'' therefor often carries a pejorative tone.

